                <strong>Context Ceiling Warning ({sat['percent']}%):</strong> Conversation has consumed {fmt_num(sat['tokens'])} of {fmt_num(sat['limit'])} tokens.
                Run <code class="mono">/compact</code> in chat to summarize prior turns and compress memory.
              </div>
            </div>
